WEBVTT - English Subtitles for Akked Explainer Video

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Your secure digital guardian protecting your personal identity.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:11.800
Instead of sending your document, the merchant sends a share request via the platform, showing you the full picture.

3
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:22.500
The request transparently shows what information will be shared—such as being eligible—and what data remains strictly inaccessible.

4
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:29.800
The proof generated by Akked is not just an image; it is an encrypted digital proof, valid for only 5 minutes.

5
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:37.200
Most importantly, it is purpose-bound for a single use and cannot be reused by any other entity.

6
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:47.300
Once you tap 'Approve and Prove', the store receives the confirmation it needs to process your order, while your full identity and private details remain hidden and completely secure in your national vault.
